  "body": "It might be useful sometime to have some debug state-poking URLs in synapse, that things like the sytest integration testing can poke. Not so much for actual test state, but currently I'm thinking it would be useful to be able to temporarily increase the verbosity of the server's logging level, so that a single test case can have more logging without causing too much unrelated spam from other tests.\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYN-118)\n\n(Reported by @leonerd)",
